2. im-ra-as,-ma 
#tr.ts: imraṣma
#tr.en: was ill,

3. {disz}hu-za-la-tum mu-ru-sa3 
#tr.ts: ḫuzālatum muru(s)sa
#tr.en: Ḫuzālatum (in) her sickness

4. i-ta-asz-szi-szi-i-ma 
#tr.ts: i(t)taššišīma
#tr.en: supported her so

5. ga-gu-um la-ma-si2 
#tr.ts: gagûm lama(s)si
#tr.en: the cloister (on) Lamassi

6. i-ri-im-ma 
#tr.ts: irēmma
#tr.en: took pity and

7. a-na hu-za-la-tum 
#tr.ts: ana ḫuzālatum
